  "description": "So Yongpal, who thought he had died in an accident, wakes up in another world. Often discriminated against in reality because of his intimidating looks, Yongpal is considered a supreme beauty by this world's standards—so much so that he even gets kidnapped by people coveting his appearance.\n\nJust before he is sold off as a slave to some pervert, a mysterious masked man rescues Yongpal…\n\nIntroducing himself as “Cryptid,” the man confesses that a spell meant to fix his own ugly appearance went wrong and accidentally summoned Yongpal instead.\n\n*“The emphasized physique and slightly indistinct facial features are so charming!”*\n\nAnd beneath the mask, contrary to his timid voice… is an absolute stunner! He's… looking at him with eyes full of desire…! *(Source: MrBlue, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000082256)",
